---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="GoalPulse privacy policy: what this site collects (almost nothing), cookies, and how to contact us about your data."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: November 2026. This page explains, in plain language, what GoalPulse collects and what it does not.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>GoalPulse is a static content site. It does not run user accounts, does not sell anything, and does not collect personal data through the articles themselves. If you use the contact form after the site is deployed with a form service, the name, email address and message you enter are sent to the site owner solely so your message can be answered. They are not sold, shared with advertisers, or used for marketing.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>This site sets no cookies of its own and runs no advertising or analytics tracking code. If advertising or analytics is added in the future, this policy will be updated before it goes live, and any third-party service involved will be named here.</p>
      <h2>Hosting and logs</h2>
      <p>Like almost every website, the hosting provider may keep short-term technical logs (for example, pages requested and approximate location derived from an IP address) for security and reliability. GoalPulse itself does not use those logs to identify individual readers.</p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>Articles may link to official sources, such as the Premier League website. Those sites have their own privacy policies, and GoalPulse is not responsible for their content or practices.</p>
      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>GoalPulse is a general football news site and does not knowingly collect information from children.</p>
      <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted here with a new date. Questions about this policy can be sent via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
